title API Sequence Diagram

participant User
participant PresentationLayer
participant Pipeline
participant UseCase
participant Repository
participant Database
participant Kafka
participant OutboundService

note over User, PresentationLayer: Update API
User -> PresentationLayer: HTTP Request (Update)
PresentationLayer -> Pipeline: Route to pipeline
Pipeline -> UseCase: Route to use case
UseCase -> Repository: Call update method
Repository -> Database: Perform update
alt Update successful
    Database --> Repository: Return success
    Repository --> UseCase: Return success
    UseCase -> PresentationLayer: Return success to client
    PresentationLayer -> User: HTTP Response (Update success)
    par CDC Flow
        Database --> Kafka: Emit change event
        Kafka --> Consumer: Notify replicas update
    end
else Update failed
    Database --> Repository: Return error
    Repository --> UseCase: Return error
    UseCase -> PresentationLayer: Handle error
    PresentationLayer -> User: HTTP Response (Update failed)
    par Error Handling Flow
        UseCase -> Kafka: Publish error event
        Kafka --> Consumers: Notify error subscribers
    end
end
